@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g1-first-schedule`
IMPORT `g1-interpretation`
IMPORT `g1-licensing-duty`

-- ind-a-tests-s2-s4.l4: independent tests by ind-a for s.2 (definitions), s.3 (duty to be licensed),
-- s.4 (false advertising) and the First Schedule.  Every expected value was decided from the sources
-- (law.wiki and the gazette pages) before the encoding was opened; the scenario ids are those of
-- work/ind-a/expectations.md.  Stated assumptions for inputs the scenario cannot supply are in the comments.

§ `ind-a fixtures`

GIVEN kw IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Cooling system`
`ind-a system of kW` kw MEANS
    `Cooling system` WITH
        `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS kw
        `refrigerants` IS EMPTY

-- Assumption: the act stays inside the "only" limits of A.1(11), A.1(12) and B.1(14).
`ind-a within the item limits` MEANS
    `Facts about an act for the limits of First Schedule items` WITH
        `the parts connected are integral control and monitoring accessories only` IS TRUE
        `the electrical work is done in the integral electrical system only` IS TRUE

GIVEN kw IS A NUMBER
      act IS A MAYBE `First Schedule activity`
      held IS A LIST OF `Licence kind`
      `not in force` IS A BOOLEAN
      commenced IS A BOOLEAN
      exempted IS A BOOLEAN
      restricted IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of work under section 3(a)`
`ind-a work in full` kw act held `not in force` commenced exempted restricted MEANS
    `Circumstances of work under section 3(a)` WITH
        `the cooling system worked on` IS `ind-a system of kW` kw
        `the activity the act amounts to` IS act
        `the limits of the item` IS `ind-a within the item limits`
        `licence kinds in force on the day` IS held
        `a licence of the person is not in force` IS `not in force`
        `the Law has commenced for the work on the system` IS commenced
        `the system is of a class exempted by an order under section 3(b)` IS exempted
        `the licensee breached a licence condition` IS FALSE
        `the licensee is restricted from the work` IS restricted
        `a provision under the Law was breached by the work` IS FALSE

-- The ordinary case: Law commenced for the work, no exemption order, every licence held is in force, no restriction.
GIVEN kw IS A NUMBER
      act IS A `First Schedule activity`
      held IS A LIST OF `Licence kind`
GIVETH A `Circumstances of work under section 3(a)`
`ind-a work` kw act held MEANS
    `ind-a work in full` kw (JUST act) held FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN advertised IS A MAYBE `Licence kind`
      held IS A LIST OF `Licence kind`
      `not in force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of a self-description under section 4`
`ind-a advertisement` advertised held `not in force` MEANS
    `Circumstances of a self-description under section 4` WITH
        `the person advertised themselves as a licensee` IS TRUE
        `the kind of licence advertised` IS advertised
        `licence kinds in force on the day` IS held
        `a licence of the person is not in force` IS `not in force`
        `the Law has commenced for the advertisement` IS TRUE

GIVEN consulted IS A BOOLEAN
      satisfied IS A BOOLEAN
      determined IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of an exemption order under section 3(b)`
`ind-a exemption order` consulted satisfied determined MEANS
    `Circumstances of an exemption order under section 3(b)` WITH
        `the Council was consulted` IS consulted
        `the Council's advice was validly given` IS consulted
        `the Minister was satisfied that work on the classes carries no risk to safety` IS satisfied
        `the Minister determined an exemption by the order` IS determined

`ind-a no grade` MEANS EMPTY
`ind-a grade 1 only` MEANS LIST `grade 1 licence`
`ind-a grade 2 only` MEANS LIST `grade 2 licence`
`ind-a grade 3 only` MEANS LIST `grade 3 licence`

§ `s.2 definitions`

-- S02-01..07: "עד 18" / "עד 70" read inclusive; a higher grade covers a smaller system.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 18)
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 18.01)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 70)
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 70.01)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 2 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 5)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 3 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 5)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 3 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 5000)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the licence kind covers the cooling system` `grade 1 licence` (`ind-a system of kW` 0.5)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` (`ind-a system of kW` 18) EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` (`ind-a system of kW` 18.01) EQUALS LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds that cover a cooling system` (`ind-a system of kW` 70.01) EQUALS LIST `grade 3 licence`

-- S02-08..10: "תעודת גמר".
`ind-a Division certificate, theory and practical` MEANS
    `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
        `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
        `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
        `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
        `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
        `the exam included a practical exam` IS TRUE
        `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
        `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE

`ind-a Division certificate, theory only` MEANS
    `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
        `issued by the Training Division` IS TRUE
        `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS TRUE
        `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS TRUE
        `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS TRUE
        `the exam included a practical exam` IS FALSE
        `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS FALSE
        `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS FALSE

`ind-a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate` MEANS
    `Facts about a certificate under section 2` WITH
        `issued by the Training Division` IS FALSE
        `evidences completion of studies in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS FALSE
        `evidences a passed exam held by the Training Division` IS FALSE
        `the exam included a theoretical exam` IS FALSE
        `the exam included a practical exam` IS FALSE
        `issued by the Ministry of Education` IS TRUE
        `evidences successful completion of studies in the climate-control stream` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `ind-a Division certificate, theory and practical`
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `ind-a Division certificate, theory only`
#ASSERT `s 2 — the certificate is a final certificate` `ind-a Ministry of Education climate-control certificate`

-- S02-11: measuring energy consumption alone is no First Schedule activity, so not "work".
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the act is work on a cooling system` NOTHING `ind-a within the item limits`
-- S02-12: system, installation or product removing heat by a refrigerant; without a refrigerant it is not.
#ASSERT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` (`Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH `a system, an installation or a product` IS TRUE, `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS TRUE, `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 2 — the thing is a cooling system` (`Facts about a thing offered as a cooling system under section 2` WITH `a system, an installation or a product` IS TRUE, `its purpose is to remove heat to the outside of a given substance or space` IS TRUE, `heat is removed by means of a refrigerant` IS FALSE)

§ `s.3 duty to be licensed`

-- S03-01
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit` `ind-a no grade`)
#ASSERT `the outcome of section 3(a) for the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit` `ind-a no grade`) EQUALS `the work is forbidden: the person holds no licence at all`
-- S03-02
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- S03-03, S03-04
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 18 `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 18.01 `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
#ASSERT `the outcome of section 3(a) for the work` (`ind-a work` 18.01 `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `ind-a grade 1 only`) EQUALS `the work is forbidden: the person holds no licence of the kind appropriate to the system and the work`
-- S03-05, S03-06, S03-07
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 70 `A.1(8) soldering or pressing piping` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 70.01 `A.1(8) soldering or pressing piping` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 10 `A.1(8) soldering or pressing piping` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
-- S03-08, S03-09
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 1000 `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
-- S03-10
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 15 `B.1(8) servicing a chiller-type system` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- S03-11 (literal reading; the contradiction with A.1(5) is reported): maintenance oil is listed only in the grade 3 row.
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- S03-12
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- S03-13 (literal reading; overlap with B.1(3) is reported)
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 30 `B.3(2) treating a refrigerant system and its components` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
-- S03-14: energy measurement only, no licence: not work.
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work in full` 5 NOTHING `ind-a no grade` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- S03-15: Law not yet commenced for this work (assumption: R-410A system, 2026-06-01, before 2027-01-16).
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work in full` 5 (JUST `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit`) `ind-a no grade` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- S03-16, S03-17: the only licence is expired / suspended (not in force on the day).
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work in full` 5 (JUST `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit`) `ind-a no grade` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- S03-18: exempted system class under s.3(b).
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work in full` 5 (JUST `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit`) `ind-a no grade` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- S03-19: grade 3 barred by a s.10(c) direction from the installation work he does.
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work in full` 5 (JUST `A.1(4) hanging an indoor unit and an outdoor unit`) `ind-a grade 3 only` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- S03-20: temporary grade 3 licence, 100 kW.
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 100 `A.1(7) commissioning the system` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
-- S03-21..24: s.3(b).  Assumption: where the Council was consulted its advice was validly given.
#ASSERT `the Minister may exempt classes of cooling systems by order` (`ind-a exemption order` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister may exempt classes of cooling systems by order` (`ind-a exemption order` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister may exempt classes of cooling systems by order` (`ind-a exemption order` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the Minister may attach duties or conditions to the exemption` (`ind-a exemption order` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- S03-25, S03-26: s.3(c).
#ASSERT `the Minister may amend the First Schedule by order` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the Minister may amend the First Schedule by order` FALSE

§ `s.4 false advertising`

-- S04-01
#ASSERT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` NOTHING `ind-a no grade` FALSE)
-- S04-02
#ASSERT NOT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` NOTHING `ind-a grade 1 only` FALSE)
-- S04-03
#ASSERT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` (JUST `grade 3 licence`) `ind-a grade 1 only` FALSE)
-- S04-04
#ASSERT NOT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` (JUST `grade 3 licence`) `ind-a grade 3 only` FALSE)
-- S04-05, S04-06 (literal reading; see the ambiguity file for the other)
#ASSERT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` (JUST `grade 2 licence`) `ind-a grade 3 only` FALSE)
#ASSERT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` (JUST `grade 1 licence`) `ind-a grade 2 only` FALSE)
-- S04-07: expired licence.
#ASSERT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` NOTHING `ind-a no grade` TRUE)
-- S04-08: temporary grade 3 licence advertised as grade 3.
#ASSERT NOT `section 4 forbids the self-description` (`ind-a advertisement` (JUST `grade 3 licence`) `ind-a grade 3 only` FALSE)

§ `First Schedule rows`

-- SCH1-A1, A1b (Part A row 1)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 10 `A.1(1) checking the permitted refrigerant quantity` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 10 `A.1(12) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- SCH1-A2 (Part A row 2)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 50 `A.1(7) commissioning the system` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
-- SCH1-A3 (Part A row 3)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 200 `A.1(10) flushing the refrigerant system` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
-- SCH1-B1, B1b (Part B row 1)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 12 `B.1(4) checking or repairing refrigerant leaks` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 12 `B.1(14) electrical work in the integral electrical system only` `ind-a grade 1 only`)
-- SCH1-B2, B2x (Part B row 2)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 60 `B.1(9) servicing the refrigeration system of cold rooms and freezer rooms` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
#ASSERT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 60 `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance` `ind-a grade 2 only`)
-- SCH1-B3, B3b (Part B row 3)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 5 `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `section 3(a) forbids the work` (`ind-a work` 500 `B.1(13) setting the protections of a chiller-type system` `ind-a grade 3 only`)
-- Which rows list an activity (column A against column B)
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance` EQUALS LIST `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do the activity` `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation` EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds that may do the activity` `B.1(1) emptying, recycling, charging or recovering refrigerant` EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`, `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds appropriate to the activity on the system` `A.1(3) testing the refrigerant piping after installation` (`ind-a system of kW` 40) EQUALS LIST `grade 2 licence`, `grade 3 licence`
